title: GuestHouseLady
---
Lady: You're not from this village are you, what can I do for you?
-> Lie
    Lin: I would like to stay for the night.
    Lin: I’m from the village on the other side of the mountain, just passing through, heading to the city.
Lady: Can I get your ID, I need to write down your information.
Lady: What a surprise, two weeks ago a handsome young man stopped by here too,
Lady: said he was from a village on the other side of the mountain.
Lady: His name was K something.. Kai right! You know him?
-> Yes (Worried)
    Lin: We live in the same village, we are good friends, is he still here?
    Lady: No, he left a few days ago.
    Lady: You know it’s strange because it turns out he wasn’t truthful about coming from a village across the mountain.
    Lady: Of course it took us a while to find out but we did..
    Lady: Anyways, here’s your ID back, let me take you to your room.
-> Yes but only by name (Wary)
    Lin: We come from the same village but we aren’t friends or anything.
    Lady: Oh that’s surprising because you know I’ve been to the village across the mountain and I’ve never heard of either of you!
    Lady: But of course maybe it’s another village, you wouldn’t lie to a old lady would you...
    Lady: Anyways, here’s your ID back, let me take you to your room.
-> No (Cautious)
    Lin: I’ve never heard of him, he’s probably not from my village.
    Lady: It’s funny though, you guys say you are from the similar place.
    Lady: Turns out though he wasn’t very truthful with us.
    Lady: You are being truthful aren’t you dear... haha of course you are,
    Lady: anyways, here’s your ID back, let me take you to your room.
===
